       Candidates (decision pending):
         SB2010   780 systems (original; Allen et al. 2015 DOCK6 paper)
         SB2012   1043 systems (expansion of SB2010)
         SB2025   1,244 systems (updates/extends SB2010 and SB2012; includes
                  cofactors and metals; described in a recent paper that
                  also benchmarks Vina and AutoDock4 with a FARMA2025 set)
         DT1244   same systems as SB2025 but prepared by a different person;
                  believed to be just receptor and ligand files (pdb or
                  mol2), i.e. less preparation than SB2025 (to verify)
         DT100    a 100-system subset (of DT1244; to verify) -- handy as a
                  quick test set while developing/translating scripts
       Options: (a) keep SB2010 for continuity with earlier DOCK6 papers,
                (b) switch to SB2025,  (c) run both and report side by side.
